    "reason": "The only evidence is a one-line PR title [ev-cd857bf3470c]. It says Crossplane may now merge existing MRDs from provider MRDs, but not when the merge happens, which MRDs or packages it touches, or whether an operator who does nothing is affected at all. The proposed undecidable leaf rests on a guess (\"existing MRDs that overlap with provider MRDs\") that the text never states. MRDs are cluster resources a predicate could read, so if the condition were known it could be written as a resource condition rather than marked undecidable. The nearby MRD items in the same section [ev-2c984df9c0e9, ev-e4abe53a35a3] do not describe this merge either; deciding exposure needs the PR description or upgrade-guide text.",
